  "releaseNotes": "0.5.0: two new rules, for 26 in all. EFD028 reports a method of the application inside a query filter or ordering, which EF Core cannot translate, and EFD030 reports a query returned after its DbContext is disposed. Rules that need only a query's origin now follow query locals composed in branches, every rule now understands DbSet.AsQueryable(), and EFD012 covers SqlQueryRaw. See CHANGELOG.md in the package.",
